  "id": "chicken-satay-salad",
  "name": "Chicken Satay Salad",
  "subtitle": "Spiced chicken with peanut-lime dressing and crisp salad vegetables",
  "description": "Curry-marinated chicken is cooked until safe, sliced, and served over crisp lettuce with a tangy peanut dressing, fresh herbs, and pomegranate.",
